        IEEE Journal of Selected Topics in Signal Processing 2026
      </p>
    
  </li>

  <li class="arxiv-result">
    <div class="is-marginless">
      <p class="list-title is-inline-block"><a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2510.00694">arXiv:2510.00694</a>
        <span>&nbsp;[<a href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/2510.00694">pdf</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/ps/2510.00694">ps</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/format/2510.00694">other</a>]&nbsp;</span>
      </p>
      <div class="tags is-inline-block">
        <span class="tag is-small is-link tooltip is-tooltip-top" data-tooltip="Computation and Language">cs.CL</span>
        
          
